      "text": "<p>With&nbsp;this&nbsp;game&nbsp;we&nbsp;challenged&nbsp;ourselves&nbsp;to&nbsp;create&nbsp;a&nbsp;fun&nbsp;experience&nbsp;that&nbsp;could&nbsp;be&nbsp;enjoyed&nbsp;with&nbsp;friends.&nbsp;After&nbsp;some&nbsp;brainstorming&nbsp;and&nbsp;conversations,&nbsp;we&nbsp;were&nbsp;drawn&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;idea&nbsp;of&nbsp;being&nbsp;attached&nbsp;to&nbsp;your&nbsp;friends&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;chaotic&nbsp;situations&nbsp;that&nbsp;could&nbsp;appear&nbsp;while&nbsp;trying&nbsp;to&nbsp;create&nbsp;certain&nbsp;shapes&nbsp;together.&nbsp;And&nbsp;just&nbsp;like&nbsp;that,&nbsp;the&nbsp;factory&nbsp;of&nbsp;stamps&nbsp;came&nbsp;to&nbsp;life.</p>",
