      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>When&nbsp;designing&nbsp;our&nbsp;main&nbsp;characters,&nbsp;I&nbsp;tried&nbsp;to&nbsp;keep&nbsp;it&nbsp;as&nbsp;simple&nbsp;as&nbsp;possible&nbsp;while&nbsp;still&nbsp;giving&nbsp;them&nbsp;certain&nbsp;characteristics&nbsp;that&nbsp;made&nbsp;them&nbsp;cute&nbsp;and&nbsp;amicable.&nbsp;In&nbsp;this&nbsp;case,&nbsp;giving&nbsp;them&nbsp;big&nbsp;black&nbsp;eyes&nbsp;worked&nbsp;to&nbsp;achieve&nbsp;this&nbsp;goal.&nbsp;Nevertheless,&nbsp;the&nbsp;weight&nbsp;of&nbsp;our&nbsp;characters&#39;&nbsp;personality&nbsp;falls&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;animation&nbsp;and&nbsp;their&nbsp;movement.&nbsp;I&nbsp;wanted&nbsp;them&nbsp;to&nbsp;feel&nbsp;like&nbsp;funny&nbsp;creatures.&nbsp;For&nbsp;that,&nbsp;I&nbsp;animated&nbsp;them&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;cartoonish-like&nbsp;way,&nbsp;exagerating&nbsp;their&nbsp;movement&nbsp;and&nbsp;scaling&nbsp;their&nbsp;feet&nbsp;when&nbsp;walking.</p>",
